<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Debug-variant override of the main launcher foreground. Keeps the
  biker-rust GTC wordmark from main unchanged, then stamps a block
  "DEBUG" label beneath it in amber so the debug build is instantly
  distinguishable on the launcher from the release install.

  Both the wordmark and the label stay inside the adaptive-icon 72×72
  safe area (x,y in 18..90) so no launcher mask clips them.
-->
